OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pay tribute to 'much-loved
OL,4,Ajoker' killed in motorbike and car
OL,5,Acrash
OL,6,
OL,7,FA motorbike rider who died after a
OL,8,Fcrash with a car on the A70 at Lanark
OL,9,Flast week has been named by police as
OL,10,FJames Gray.
OL,12,FThe 57-year-old's black Suzuki GSX-R
OL,13,Fcollided with a silver Renault Master
OL,14,Fvan at about 15:20 on 24 August. He was
OL,15,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,17,FHis family said they were "heartbroken
OL,18,Fat the sudden loss of our dad,
OL,19,Fgrandpops, brother, partner,
OL,20,Ffather-in-law, uncle and great friend
OL,21,Fto many".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
